          "stem_markdown": "The time, \\(T\\) minutes, for a certain daily bus journey is normally distributed. The bus company claims that the mean of \\(T\\) is 45. A passenger believes that the mean of \\(T\\) is actually greater than 45. She notes the times taken for this journey on a random sample of 60 days. The results are summarised below.\n\n\\[\nn = 60 \\qquad \\sum t = 2750 \\qquad \\sum t^2 = 127000\n\\]",
